<title>USA: New Plan Realty Jul 31 yr shr $1.25 vs $1.19.</title>
<headline>New Plan Realty Jul 31 yr shr $1.25 vs $1.19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.25		    $1.19</p>
<p> Net		 70,521.0		 62,716.0</p>
<p> Revs		167,606.0		130,576.0</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  56,484,000	     52,894,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: New Plan Realty Chairman William Newman said gains reflected the addition of 21 new properties bought during the fiscal year combined with strong internal growth.</p>
<p>Company president Arnold Laubich said the trust's acquisition activity in fiscal 1997 would continue at about the same pace as last year when it invested over $200 million in retail and residential properties.</p>
</text>
